{"vid":"rYhJHQR_J8A","source":"rYhJHQR_J8A.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"Well, I mean, if I had to, you know, go"},{"t":1.6,"txt":"back and think to when I was a kid, you"},{"t":3.4,"txt":"know, I felt like that hopelessness of,"},{"t":5.8,"txt":"you know, dead-end jobs. Welding has"},{"t":7.8,"txt":"allowed me to to be able to feel like I"},{"t":10.4,"txt":"have a career. I started my own shop 3"},{"t":12.7,"txt":"years ago, Fuller Hot Rods in Atlanta."},{"t":15.3,"txt":"We build custom cars, custom bikes,"},{"t":17.4,"txt":"mainly specialize in metal. Basically,"},{"t":19.3,"txt":"we just build whatever we want. Long as"},{"t":20.8,"txt":"the customer is happy and we build"},{"t":22.2,"txt":"something that he's pleased with. Uh, we"},{"t":24.6,"txt":"pretty much kind of have free reign to"},{"t":27.1,"txt":"do what makes us happy. overhauling came"},{"t":29.5,"txt":"in and overhauling we did a 56 Bair"},{"t":32.3,"txt":"that's where I met Troy and Brian Fuller"},{"t":35.5,"txt":"and Jeff Boots and all those just"},{"t":37.7,"txt":"phenomenal phenomenal metal fabricators"},{"t":40.8,"txt":"and everybody was so happy I guess with"},{"t":43.9,"txt":"what I did they asked me to come back"},{"t":45.1,"txt":"and do another overall. So by the time"},{"t":47.4,"txt":"that I was done with the SEMA car, I had"},{"t":49.8,"txt":"experience working on show cars, working"},{"t":51.7,"txt":"under deadlines, working on television,"},{"t":54.1,"txt":"and with all of that, I got the job with"},{"t":56.8,"txt":"Extreme 4x4. So for the past 3 and 1/2"},{"t":59.4,"txt":"years, I've been building off-road"},{"t":61.4,"txt":"trucks on a how-to show for millions of"},{"t":64.1,"txt":"people, teaching them how to how to"},{"t":66,"txt":"build cool machines. When I when I won"},{"t":68.7,"txt":"hot rod of the year, it was exciting"},{"t":70,"txt":"because, you know, I I grew up running"},{"t":71.8,"txt":"to the news stand looking at hot rod"},{"t":73.2,"txt":"magazine and to be recognized as a young"},{"t":76.6,"txt":"guy and to get hot rod of the year. I"},{"t":78.7,"txt":"mean, it was it was awesome. I mean,"},{"t":80.2,"txt":"you're on top of the world. I get a lot"},{"t":81.8,"txt":"of people come by the shop now cuz of"},{"t":83.4,"txt":"our this few shows we've done and being"},{"t":85.4,"txt":"in Howard Magazine, everything. And I"},{"t":86.7,"txt":"get a lot of young guys, you know, we go"},{"t":88,"txt":"out and speak at the college once a year"},{"t":89.8,"txt":"at Wild Tech uh to the graduating class."},{"t":92,"txt":"We do a lot of job shadowing at the shop"},{"t":94,"txt":"from the local high schools and uh you"},{"t":96.2,"txt":"know we throw a welding helmet on these"},{"t":97.4,"txt":"kids. Some of them never been around it"},{"t":98.6,"txt":"and some of them have had a shop class."},{"t":100.8,"txt":"So we'll throw a welding helmet on them."},{"t":102.2,"txt":"They'll hang around during the day and"},{"t":103.4,"txt":"kind of see how cool it is. We got the"},{"t":105,"txt":"cars we're doing in bare metal. We got"},{"t":106.4,"txt":"the finished cars so they can see what"},{"t":107.8,"txt":"it takes to to do something and welding"},{"t":109.9,"txt":"it all together. There's so much"},{"t":111.4,"txt":"opportunity. You know, I got into"},{"t":113.2,"txt":"welding, you know, kind of like a lot of"},{"t":114.6,"txt":"people did out of necessity. If you want"},{"t":116.6,"txt":"to build something bad enough, you have"},{"t":118.8,"txt":"to learn to weld. I mean, that's just"},{"t":120.6,"txt":"part of the gig. And eventually I ended"},{"t":122.7,"txt":"up in a tech school where I was actually"},{"t":124.9,"txt":"taught and trained on, you know, how to"},{"t":126.9,"txt":"MIG, how to TIG, how to gas. It's been a"},{"t":129.4,"txt":"great experience and and it's just, you"},{"t":131.2,"txt":"know, really allowed me to be able to"},{"t":132.7,"txt":"build what I want to build. You even my"},{"t":135.3,"txt":"classmates from Wiiotech, they not all"},{"t":137.4,"txt":"of them have gone down the automotive"},{"t":139.3,"txt":"field. A lot of them are working with um"},{"t":141.8,"txt":"structural like building buildings and"},{"t":143.4,"txt":"skyscrapers like with all these new"},{"t":145,"txt":"condos booming up. There's a couple guys"},{"t":146.6,"txt":"that are doing art. A few guys have gone"},{"t":149.4,"txt":"up to work on the pipeline and those"},{"t":151.7,"txt":"guys make a killing. They make good"},{"t":154.6,"txt":"money. They have time to play and"},{"t":156.7,"txt":"they're happy. There's there's very good"},{"t":159,"txt":"money to be made in the industry. You"},{"t":160.6,"txt":"know, whether you're welding cars"},{"t":161.8,"txt":"together, bikes, uh highrises, whatever."},{"t":164.2,"txt":"You know, it's the same thing. I enjoy"},{"t":165.4,"txt":"the freedom and the creativity to be"},{"t":166.7,"txt":"able to build whatever you want. And"},{"t":168.5,"txt":"that's what welding allows you to do is"},{"t":170.1,"txt":"you make something and you can put it"},{"t":172.2,"txt":"together. When I talk to employers, they"},{"t":174.2,"txt":"they constantly tell me, they say, \"Some"},{"t":176.1,"txt":"of the best welders I have ever had are"},{"t":178.2,"txt":"women. They just have that patience."},{"t":180,"txt":"They have that rhythm. They have the"},{"t":182.2,"txt":"attention to detail. There should be no"},{"t":184,"txt":"fear for women getting in the welding"},{"t":185.4,"txt":"industry at all.\" My grandfather was a"},{"t":187.4,"txt":"pipe fitter and we you know, he was the"},{"t":189,"txt":"old guy that everybody go have Johnny"},{"t":190.9,"txt":"welding. I spent uh a lot of lot of time"},{"t":193,"txt":"brazing pop cans together and there, you"},{"t":194.7,"txt":"know, taking a wire wire brush with a"},{"t":197.2,"txt":"piece of pipe look like I came off the"},{"t":198.6,"txt":"Titanic. You know, clean that up. We're"},{"t":199.9,"txt":"going to make a basketball pole. you"},{"t":201,"txt":"know, you scrub on it for days and"},{"t":202.4,"txt":"things chrome and it was I'm like, \"Is"},{"t":204.1,"txt":"that good enough?\" \"No, not good enough."},{"t":205.4,"txt":"Never good enough.\" So, and that's what"},{"t":206.9,"txt":"I tell my guys at the shop. If you're"},{"t":208.3,"txt":"cleaning the shop up or you're buffing"},{"t":210.1,"txt":"that $2 million car, it's the same job"},{"t":212.7,"txt":"for me. You know, everything's got to be"},{"t":214.2,"txt":"done the right way. And uh I think he"},{"t":216,"txt":"instilled that in me and has kept kept"},{"t":218.2,"txt":"that focus. And then you can instill it"},{"t":220.1,"txt":"in these young kids, man. It's it's an"},{"t":222.2,"txt":"instant home run. Get connected to the"},{"t":224,"txt":"job you want through the American"},{"t":225.4,"txt":"Welding Society. With a career in"},{"t":227.3,"txt":"welding, you'll have great opportunities"},{"t":229.2,"txt":"right at home or anywhere around the"},{"t":231.4,"txt":"world. Decide where you want to be and"},{"t":233.4,"txt":"welding will get you there."},{"t":235.2,"txt":"Transportation, manufacturing, power"},{"t":237.4,"txt":"creation, and delivery, the list goes"},{"t":239.8,"txt":"on. Every aspect of our daily lives is"},{"t":242.4,"txt":"affected and made better by welding. So,"},{"t":245.1,"txt":"skilled welders are always in high"},{"t":247,"txt":"demand. Welding careers offer excellent"},{"t":249.3,"txt":"opportunities to make great money in the"},{"t":251,"txt":"exciting field of your choice. So, if"},{"t":253.2,"txt":"you want a career that combines hands-on"},{"t":255,"txt":"skill with creativity, take the first"},{"t":257.3,"txt":"step by visiting aws.org."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"Well,"},{"t":0.16,"w":"I"},{"t":0.24,"w":"mean,"},{"t":0.32,"w":"if"},{"t":0.48,"w":"I"},{"t":0.56,"w":"had"},{"t":0.719,"w":"to,"},{"t":1.04,"w":"you"},{"t":1.199,"w":"know,"},{"t":1.439,"w":"go"},{"t":1.6,"w":"back"},{"t":1.839,"w":"and"